  "details": "This ones a bit of a doozy without the proper hardware, however when using a controller with full finger tracking, ie a glove with joystick and buttons, the control method used for optical based hand tracking is still enabled.\n\nDisabling this in the controls submenu in settings does not solve this, and cannot be unbound in either the controls or steamvr bindings ui.\n\nThere is also no way to forcibly ignore these inputs like there is for steamvr inputs.\n\nI believe a toggle to remove the ability to control VRC via these hand controls and allow users with more specialist hardware to use the physical buttons in their hands would be a good thing and would only positively affect the experience.",
